 <h3><u>Utho abbas</u></h3> 
 <div style=width:100%> 
  <p><b><u><font size=4></font></u></b></p>
  <p><b><u><font size=4>Utho abbas</font></u></b></p>
  <b><u><font size=4> </font></u></b>
  <font size=4> <p>(Ya abbas) x2</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>Ek bhatija ke siwa koi madadgar nahi</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>Sham jaana hai rida sar pe nahi hai bhaya</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>Dile gham zadaa kare ye buka,</p> <p>Behan ka nahi koi aasra,</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>Ghar se nikli thi to mehmil me bithaya tune</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>Safar dusra shuroo hai mera,</p> <p>Chali chawd ke behan karbela,</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>Mayne yasrab ki bhi galiya na kabhi dekhi thi </p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>Behan kya kare milenge mujhe,</p> <p>Naye log or naye raste,</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>maa ki tarha se mein darbare sitam jawoongi</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>bataawo zaraa mere bawafaa,</p> <p>garibul watan kare kya bhala</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>samne kaise me shiri ka karungi socho</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>karoo mein fugaa bandhi reshwa,</p> <p>huwi kayd sab nabi zaadiya,</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>kya gawaara hein ke sab dekhe khule sar mujko</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>duwa do mujhe sikha do mujhe,</p> <p>chaloo kis tarha bataado mujhe,</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>shimr marega sakina ko behan royengi</p> <p>(haye abbas utho) x2</p> <p>kerenge sitam laeen har kadam,</p> <p>tu hein har kadam bhulayenge hum</p> <p>(utho abbas bahan waqife-e bazaar nahi) x2</p> <p>kaise jayengi nabizadi sitam gharo mein</p></font>
